Dear Valued Customer, We hope this message finds you well. At Secure Banking, your security and privacy are our top priorities. We are constantly working to enhance our services and ensure that your financial information remains protected. We are excited to announce several new security features that will be implemented over the next few weeks. These enhancements are designed to provide you with greater control over your account and to help safeguard your personal information. **1. Two-Factor Authentication (2FA):** Starting next month, we will be rolling out two-factor authentication for all customer accounts. This additional layer of security will require you to verify your identity using a secondary method, such as a text message or an authentication app, whenever you log in from a new device. **2. Account Activity Notifications:** You will soon receive instant notifications via email or SMS whenever there is unusual activity on your account. This feature will help you stay informed and take immediate action if necessary. **3. Enhanced Password Management:** We will also be introducing a password strength checker during the account creation and password reset processes. This tool will guide you in creating a strong password, helping to protect your account from unauthorized access. **4. Security Awareness Resources:** To further assist you, we will provide educational materials on how to recognize phishing attempts and other cyber threats. Look for our upcoming newsletter, which will include tips on maintaining your